                  <h3 class="h4 mb-3">Introduction to Our Projects</h3>
                  <p class="mb-3">
                    Astechware is a small, focused team that designs and builds AI automations and custom software for
                    growing businesses. We combine deep technical expertise with a strong understanding of operations,
                    helping teams replace manual work with reliable systems.
                  </p>
                  <p class="mb-3">
                    From lead handling and customer communication to internal tools and complex platforms, we partner with
                    founders and operators to ship production‑ready solutions that actually get used. Our work spans
                    fintech, real estate, marketplaces, events, and local services.
                  </p>
                  <p class="mb-4">
                    The projects featured here represent a range of client work across different industries and use cases.
                    Each project addresses real business challenges with custom-built solutions designed for scale and
                    usability. Use the tabs to explore each project in detail, including walkthrough videos that explain
                    the context, technology choices, and client outcomes.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
